DESCRIPTION:Encounter Minior in its Meteor Form in the wild and receive 1\,
 000 Stardust for catching it. Shooting stars light up the in-game sky from
  5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time daily\, offering increased chances to e
 ncounter Minior. Minior begins battles in its Meteor Form and changes form
  when its health drops below 50%.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/events/minior-sh
 owers-leonids-2026/
