URL:https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
DESCRIPTION:Pawniard will appear more frequently in the wild and from regul
 ar Lure Modules with a high chance of encountering Shiny ones or those wit
 h Special Backgrounds. Evolve Bisharp during the event or up to four hours
  afterwards to get a Kingambit that knows the Charged Attack Kowtow Cleave
 . Take snapshots for photobomb surprises and complete themed Field Researc
 h and optional paid Special Research for rewards.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/
 events/november-communityday2026/
END:VEVENT
